 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Amazon Pinpoint SMS Voice V2 API (2022-03-31). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Configuration sets and opt-out lists are configuration metadata: no text, voice or media message is sent, no phone number, sender ID, pool or registration is requested, and SendTextMessage and the other sending APIs return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501. Event destinations, default sender settings, opted-out numbers, protect configurations and spend limits are not implemented. The account's Default opt-out list is not pre-created and its name is reserved. Describe filters and the Owner member are refused.",
  "title": "AWS End User Messaging SMS (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2022-03-31"
 },
